hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1034","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke dehatiyon mein se ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main Aap ko Allah ki qasam deta hun ke mere liye Allah ki kitab se faisla karen. To doosra bola jo us se ziyada faqeeh tha: Han, hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karen aur mujhe ijazat den. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. Us ne kaha: Beshak mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha aur us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya; aur mujhe bataya gaya ke mere bete par rajm hai, to main ne us se sau bakriyan aur bandi fidye mein din. Phir main ne ilm walon se poocha to unhon ne mujhe bataya ke mere bete par siwae sau kode aur ek saal jila-watni ke kuch nahin hai, aur is aadmi ki biwi par rajm hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main tum donon ke darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karunga: Bandi aur bakriyan tumhen wapas hain; aur tumhare bete par sau kode aur ek saal jila-watni hai; aur Aey Unais! Is ki biwi ke paas subah jao, phir agar iqrar kare to use rajm karo. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1035","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh se lo, mujh se lo; Allah ne un ke liye raasta bana diya hai: kunware ka kunwari se sau kode aur ek saal jila-watni; aur shadi-shuda ka shadi-shuda se sau kode aur rajm. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1036","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Musalmanon mein se ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap masjid mein the, to us ne Aap ko pukara aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne zina kiya hai. To Aap ne us se munh pher liya. To woh Aap ke chehre ke samne hata. Phir kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne zina kiya hai. To Aap ne us se munh pher liya, yahan tak ke us ne Aap par chaar martaba dohraaya. Phir jab us ne apne nafs par chaar gawahiyan din to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur farmaya: Kya tum deewane ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum shadi-shuda ho? Us ne kaha: Han. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use le jao aur rajm karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"1037","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Ma'iz bin Malik Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne us se farmaya: Shayad tum ne bosa liya, ya ishara kiya, ya dekha? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Ya Rasulullah! Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1038","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne khutba diya aur kaha: Beshak Allah ne Muhammad ko haq ke sath bheja aur un par kitab nazil ki; to jo Allah ne un par nazil kiya us mein rajm ki aayat thi. Ham ne use padha, yaad kiya aur samjha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rajm kiya aur ham ne Aap ke baad rajm kiya. To mujhe khauf hai ke agar logon par zamana lamba ho jae to koi kehne wala kahe: Ham Allah ki kitab mein rajm nahin pate, to Allah ke nazil karda fareeze ko chhorne se gumrah ho jaen; aur beshak rajm Allah ki kitab mein haq hai us par jo zina kare jab shadi-shuda ho mard aur aurton mein se, jab gawahi qaem ho ya hamal ho ya iqrar ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"1039","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum mein se kisi ki bandi zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jae to use hadd lagaye aur use malamat na kare; phir agar zina kare to use hadd lagaye aur use malamat na kare; phir agar teesri martaba zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jae to use bech de agarche baal ki rassi se. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1040","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hudud un par qaem karo jo tumhare dayen hath malik hon. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh Muslim mein mauqoof hai."
"1041","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Juhainah ki ek aurat Nabiullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke woh zina se hamla thi. To us ne kaha: Ya Nabiullah! Main hadd ko pahunchi hun to mujh par qaem karen. To Nabiullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke wali ko bulaya aur farmaya: Us se achcha sulook karo; phir jab woh jan de to use mere paas lao. To us ne aisa kiya. Phir Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya to us par us ke kapde bandhe gae, phir Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya to rajm ki gayi, phir Aap ne us par namaz padhi. To Umar ne kaha: Kya Aap us par namaz padhte hain Aey Nabiullah jabke us ne zina kiya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Us ne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar Madinah walon mein se sattar mein taqseem ki jae to unhen kafi ho; aur kya us ne is se afzal paya ke apni jaan Allah ke liye de di? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1042","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aslam ke ek aadmi, Yahud ke ek aadmi aur ek aurat ko rajm kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur dono Yahudiyon ke rajm ka qissa Sahihain mein Ibn Umar ki hadees se hai."
"1043","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Sa'd bin Ubadah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke hamare gharon ke darmiyan ek kamzor chhota aadmi tha jo un ki ek bandi se bura kaam kar betha. To Sa'd ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use us ki hadd lagao. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak woh us se ziyada kamzor hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Khajur ka khosha lo jis mein sau tehniyan hon, phir use us se ek martaba maro. To unhon ne aisa kiya. Ise Ahmad, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad hasan hai; lekin is ke mausul aur mursal hone mein ikhtilaf hua."
"1044","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise pao ke woh Qaun Lut ka fe'l karta hai to karne wale aur jis se kiya jae donon ko qatl karo; aur jise pao ke woh janwar par gira hai to use qatl karo aur janwar ko qatl karo. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal mawasooq hain, magar is mein ikhtilaf hai."
"1045","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kode lagaye aur jila-watan kiya, aur Abu Bakr ne kode lagaye aur jila-watan kiya. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain, magar is ke marfoo' aur mauqoof hone mein ikhtilaf hua."
"1046","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton jaise mardon aur mardon jaisi aurton par la'nat ki, aur farmaya: Unhen apne gharon se nikalo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1047","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hudud ko door karo jahan un ke liye door karne ki jagah pao. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad za'if hai; aur Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne ise Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ki hadees se is lafz se nikala: Musalmanon se hudud ko door karo jahan tak ho sake. Aur yeh bhi za'if hai; aur Baihaqi ne ise Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se un ke qaul se riwayat kiya."
"1048","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: In gandagiyon se bacho jin se Allah Ta'ala ne mana farmaya hai; phir jo un mein mubtala ho woh Allah Ta'ala ke parde se parda kare aur Allah Ta'ala ki taraf tauba kare; kyunke jo ham par apna chehra zahir kare ham us par Allah Azza wa Jalla ki kitab qaem karenge. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh Muwatta mein Zaid bin Aslam ke maraseel se hai."
"1049","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jab mera uzr nazil hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par khade hue aur is ka zikr kiya aur Quran padha; phir jab utre to do mardon aur ek aurat ke bare mein hukm diya aur unhen hadd lagai gayi. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ne is ki taraf ishara kiya."
"1050","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Islam mein pahla li'an yeh tha ke Sharik bin Samha' par Hilal bin Umayyah ne us ki biwi se tohmat lagai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Gawah, warna tumhari peeth par hadd hai. Al-hadees. Ise Abu Ya'la ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur yeh Bukhari mein Ibn Abbas ki hadees se isi tarah hai."
"1051","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah se riwayat hai ke main ne Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhum) aur un ke baad walon ko paya; to main ne unhen ghulam ko tohmat mein chalis ke siwa marte nahin dekha. Ise Malik aur Sauri ne apne Jami' mein riwayat kiya."
"1052","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam par tohmat lagae us par qayamat ke din hadd qaem ki jaegi siwae is ke ke woh waisa ho jaisa us ne kaha. Muttafaq alaih."
"1053","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chor ka hath siwae chauthai dinar ya us se upar mein nahin kata jaega. Muttafaq alaih; aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur Bukhari ke alfaz hain: Hath chauthai dinar ya us se upar mein kata jata hai. Aur Ahmad ki ek riwayat mein hai: Chauthai dinar mein kato, aur us mein na kato jo us se kam ho."
"1054","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dhal mein hath kata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi. Muttafaq alaih."
"1055","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah chor par la'nat kare; woh anda chori karta hai to us ka hath kata jata hai, aur rassi chori karta hai to us ka hath kata jata hai. Ise bhi Muttafaq alaih riwayat kiya gaya."
"1056","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum Allah ki hudood mein se ek hadd mein sifarish karte ho? Phir khade hue aur khutba diya. Phir farmaya: Aey logo! Beshak tum se pahle wale is liye halak hue ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to use chhor dete, aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaem karte... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur unhi ke han doosri wajh se hai ke Aishah se hai: Ek aurat saman aariyat leti aur inkar karti thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ka hath katne ka hukm diya."
"1057","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Khain, lootne wale aur ukhadne wale par hath katna nahin hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1058","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Phal aur khajur ke gude mein hath katna nahin hai. Ise mazkooron ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise bhi sahih kaha."
"1059","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umayyah Makhzumi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chor laya gaya jis ne iqrar kiya tha, magar us ke paas saman na paya gaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main nahin samajhta ke tum ne chori ki hai. Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin. To Aap ne us par do ya teen martaba dohraaya. Phir us ke bare mein hukm diya to hath kata gaya. Aur use laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Allah se istighfar karo aur Us ki taraf tauba karo. To us ne kaha: Main Allah se istighfar karta hun aur Us ki taraf tauba karta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah us par tauba qabool farma, teen martaba. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz unhi ke hain, aur Ahmad aur Nasai ne; aur is ke rijaal siqah hain. Aur Hakim ne ise Abu Hurairah ki hadees se nikala aur isi ma'na se chalaya, aur us mein kaha: Use le jao aur kato, phir dagho. Aur Bazzar ne bhi ise nikala aur kaha: Is ki sanad mein harj nahin hai."
"1060","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Awf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chor par jurmana nahin hai jab us par hadd qaem ki jae. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur wazeh kiya ke yeh munqati' hai; aur Abu Hatim ne kaha: Yeh munkar hai."
"1061","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap se latki hui khajur ke bare mein poocha gaya? To Aap ne farmaya: Jo munh se hajat wale ke taur par khae baghair thaile banaye to us par kuch nahin hai; aur jo us mein se kuch lekar nikle to us par jurmana aur saza hai; aur jo us mein se kuch lekar nikle us ke baad ke use khalihan mein rakha jae aur woh dhal ki qeemat ko pahunche to us par hath katna hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1062","[AI-translation] Hazrat Safwan bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya jab Aap ne us ke hath katne ka hukm diya jis ne us ki chadar chori ki thi aur us ne us mein sifarish ki: Kya yeh is se pahle na tha ke tum use mere paas lao? Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Jarud aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1063","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chor laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne to chori ki hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use kato. To hath kata gaya. Phir doosri martaba laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. To isi tarah zikr kiya. Phir chauthi martaba isi tarah laya gaya. Phir panchwin martaba laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur ise munkar kaha; aur Haris bin Hatib ki hadees se isi tarah nikala; aur Shafi'i ne zikr kiya ke panchwin mein qatl mansookh hai."
"1064","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek aadmi laya gaya jis ne sharab pi thi, to Aap ne use do chhadion se taqreeban chalis lagaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Bakr ne aisa kiya; phir jab Umar hue to logon se mashwara kiya. To Abdur Rahman bin Awf ne kaha: Hudood mein sab se halki assi hai. To Umar ne us ka hukm diya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se Waleed bin Uqbah ke qisse mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chalis lagaye, Abu Bakr ne chalis, Umar ne assi; aur sab sunnat hai, aur yeh mujhe ziyada mahboob hai. Aur is hadees mein hai ke ek aadmi ne gawahi di ke us ne use sharab qai karte dekha tha. To Usman ne kaha: Us ne use siwae peene ke baad qai nahin kiya."
"1065","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne sharab peene wale ke bare mein farmaya: Jab woh piye to use kode lagao, phir jab [doosri] piye to use kode lagao, phir jab teesri piye to use kode lagao, phir jab chauthi piye to us ki gardan maro. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur yeh unhi ke alfaz hain, aur Arba'a ne. Aur Tirmidhi ne woh zikr kiya jo dalalat karta hai ke yeh mansookh hai; aur Abu Dawud ne use sareeh nikala."
"1066","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi mare to chehre se bache. Muttafaq alaih."
"1067","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hudud masajid mein qaem na ki jaen. Ise Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"1068","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Allah ne sharab ki hurmat nazil ki jabke Madinah mein koi peene ka mashroob na tha siwae khajur ke. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1069","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke sharab ki hurmat nazil hui jabke woh paanch se thi: angoor, khajur, shehed, gehn aur jau se. Aur sharab woh hai jo aql ko dhank le. Muttafaq alaih."
"1070","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Har nasha dene wali sharab hai, aur har nasha dene wali haram hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1071","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka ziyada nasha de us ka thoda haram hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1072","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkeeze mein kishmish ka sharbat banaya jata tha; to Aap use us din, agle din aur us ke agle din peete; phir jab teesri shaam hoti to use peete aur pilate; phir agar kuch bachta to use baha dete. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1073","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumhari shifa us mein nahin rakhi jo tum par haram kiya hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1074","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wa'il Hadrami se riwayat hai ke Tariq bin Suwaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sharab ke bare mein poocha jo woh dawa ke liye banata tha? To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak woh dawa nahin hai, lekin woh beemari hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud aur ghair ne."
"1075","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Burdah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Dus kodon se upar siwae Allah ki hudood mein se ek hadd ke na lagao. Muttafaq alaih."
"1076","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Martabe walon ki laghzishen mu'af karo siwae hudood ke. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"1077","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main kisi par hadd qaem na karunga aur woh mar jae to apne dil mein paun siwae sharab peene wale ke; kyunke agar woh mar jae to us ki diyat dunga. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1078","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1079","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Khabbab se riwayat hai ke main ne apne walid (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate suna ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Fitne honge; to un mein Allah ke maqtool bande bano, aur qatil na bano. Ise Ibn Abi Khaithamah aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ne isi tarah Khalid bin Urfutah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya."
